message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "peptide-rpes: RPES scoring and peptide-representation benchmark"
abstract: "Reproduction package for a methods/resource paper on RPES (Rank-Percentile Ensemble Score) — a ceiling-effect-free peptide bioactivity ranking score — and a head-to-head benchmark of physicochemical descriptors, a PCA latent space, and ESM-2 embeddings for short food-derived peptides."
